WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.940
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:05.820
[TIRES SQUEAL]

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.620
- Alan, this species of cartoon
has been extinct since 1998.

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:20.320
I mean, these haven't been
seen on TV since the golden era

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.540
of animation.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:24.370
And, and-- what?

00:00:32.002 --> 00:00:32.802
- La!

00:00:35.778 --> 00:00:38.365
- It's-- it's the
Warner brothers.

00:00:38.365 --> 00:00:41.155
- And the Warner sister!

00:00:41.155 --> 00:00:42.970
- [LAUGHS] That's-- yeah.

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:43.910
Oh, yeah.
Yeah.

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:45.060
Yeah.
- He-- he did it.

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:49.620
That, that, that, that crazy
son of a gun actually did it.

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:53.200
- Clean vectored outlines,
wide screen format.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.820
- Theses don't look like reruns.

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:55.620
[HONK]

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:57.030
- Well, they're not.

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:59.940
[LAUGHS] I reanimated them.

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:04.080
- We are gonna make a
fortune with this show.

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:06.715
- How zany are they?

00:01:06.715 --> 00:01:07.620
- Oh, to the max.

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:08.820
[SPLAT]

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:12.060
Of course, then there's
Pinky and the Brain.

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:13.340
- Pinky and the Brain?

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:15.610
You said you're bringing
back Pinky and the Brain?

00:01:15.610 --> 00:01:16.410
- Mm-hmm.

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:17.680
- Say it again.

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:21.670
- We're bringing back
Pinky and the Brain.

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:24.340
- Put your head
between your knees.

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:26.840
- Boingy, boingy,
boingy, boingy!

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:28.180
- Where are they going?

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:29.380
- Home.

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:31.690
Welcome to "Animaniacs."

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:34.140
- (SINGING) Those are the facts!

